+  <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="tip-card"><span class="tip-spark">✳</span><b>A little progress<br>goes a long way.</b><p>Keep your focus on what matters today.</p></div><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">Y</div><div><b>Your space</b><small>Personal workspace</small></div><button class="icon-button" id="settingsBtn" title="Board settings">⚙</button></div></div>
+</aside>
+<main class="main-area">
+<header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <b id="crumb">My board</b></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="icon-button" id="exportBtn" title="Export board">⇩</button><label class="icon-button import-label" title="Import board">⇧<input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json" hidden></label><div class="top-avatar">Y</div></div></header>
+<section class="content"><div class="greeting-row"><div><div class="eyebrow" id="dateLine">YOUR DAY, YOUR PACE</div><h1 id="heading">My board<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p class="subtitle" id="subtitle">A clear mind starts with a clear plan.</p></div><button class="primary-button" id="addTask"><span>＋</span> Add task</button></div>
+<div class="toolbar"><div class="filters"><button class="filter-pill selected" data-filter="all">All tasks</button><button class="filter-pill" data-filter="high">High priority</button><button class="filter-pill" data-filter="overdue">Overdue</button></div><div class="toolbar-tools"><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search tasks…" aria-label="Search tasks"><kbd>/</kbd></label><select id="sort" aria-label="Sort tasks"><option value="manual">Manual order</option><option value="due">Due date</option><option value="priority">Priority</option><option value="created">Date added</option></select></div></div>
+<div class="board" id="board" aria-label="Kanban board"></div>
+<footer class="board-footer"><span><i class="sync-dot"></i> Saved on this device</span><span>Drag tasks to move them <span class="footer-sep">·</span> <button id="clearCompleted">Clear completed</button></span></footer></section>
+</main></div>
+<div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdrop" hidden><section class="task-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle"><div class="modal-top"><span class="modal-kicker">TASK DETAILS</span><button class="icon-button" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><h2 id="modalTitle">Add a task</h2><form id="taskForm"><label class="field-label" for="taskTitle">Task name</label><input id="taskTitle" class="title-input" maxlength="140" placeholder="What needs to get done?" required><label class="field-label" for="taskDescription">Notes <span>OPTIONAL</span></label><textarea id="taskDescription" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Add a little context…"></textarea><div class="form-row"><div><label class="field-label" for="taskStatus">Column</label><select id="taskStatus"><option value="todo">To do</option><option value="doing">In progress</option><option value="done">Done</option></select></div><div><label class="field-label" for="taskPriority">Priority</label><select id="taskPriority"><option value="none">No priority</option><option value="low">Low</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="high">High</option></select></div></div><div class="form-row"><div><label class="field-label" for="taskDue">Due date</label><input id="taskDue" type="date"></div><div><label class="field-label" for="taskTags">Tags <span>COMMA SEPARATED</span></label><input id="taskTags" maxlength="100" placeholder="work, personal"></div></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="text-button danger" id="deleteTask" hidden>Delete task</button><span class="action-spacer"></span><button type="button" class="secondary-button" id="cancelModal">Cancel</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Save task</button></div></form></section></div>
+<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
+<script src="app.js"></script>
+</body></html>
